    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d844">

                <pb facs="0862" n="850" sameAs="frus:frus1941v02/pg850"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">853B.014/30</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of Conversation, by the Under Secretary of
                        State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Welles</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-06-18">June 18, 1941</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Mr. Butler<anchor n="17" xml:id="d844-f1"/> of the British Embassy called to see
                    me this morning at his request. Mr. Butler requested me to submit to the
                    President the <pb facs="0863" n="851" xml:id="pg851"/> following request of the
                    Prime Minister which he understood had already, at least in part, been under
                    consideration by the President.</p>
                <p>The British Government desired to know whether the Government of the United
                    States would be prepared immediately to undertake joint staff conversations with
                    the British Government to agree upon plans covering the occupation of the
                    Azores, such plans to be contingent upon the unwillingness of the Prime Minister
                    of Portugal to request assistance of the British and United States Governments
                    in the defense of the independence and integrity of those islands.</p>
                <p>I stated to Mr. Butler that I would submit this request immediately to the
                    President and let the British Ambassador have the President’s reply.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>S[<hi rendition="#small-caps">umner</hi>] W[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >elles</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d844-f1" n="17" xml:id="d844-f1-content">
                <p>Nevile M. Butler, British Minister.</p>
